  "verseCount": 19,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1PE 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abarendi abaya b’obuya bwa Nyasae",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaki, ekiagera Kristo achandetwe ase omobere, nainwe boigo eboyie ebirwanero bi’ebirengererio ebio ebio, ekiagera ere oyochandetwe ase omobere bweatananire korwa ase ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa bono ase amatuko aya atigarete more moyo, timogenderera koreng’ana nokogania okobe kwa Mwanyabaanto, korende koreng’ana nogwancha kwa Nyasae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki engaki yaino eye yaetire yaisanire ase ogokora aya abanto b’Ebisaku banchete gokora. Igo mwagendererete ase obonyaka, na okogania okobe, na okonywa, na emeyega y’okoria bobe na gotinda, na mware gosasiima emegwekano, ogosasiima gotarenge okoronge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, barabwo nigo bakorora ng’a nay’ogokumia, ekiagera inwe motari koayerera amo nabarabwo gochia ase obonyaka botari nekerengo, na nigo bakobarama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende barabwo nigo barache korua omobaro asare ere oyore ang’e kogambia abare moyo na abakuure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakio kiagerete abakuure bakaranderigwa enchiri, erinde bagambigwe ase omobere koreng’ana buna Mwanyabaanto bakogambigwa, na babe moyo ase omoika, koreng’ana buna Nyasae are moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono omoerio bw’amang’ana onsi oikire ang’e. Ase ayio, mobe nobong’aini na kwerita ase ogosaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kobua ase onsi mobe nomokia ase ogwanchana, ekiagera obwanchani nigo bogotuba obonge bw’ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mobe abamokoroisania inwe ase inwe motari kwemurungania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mokorerane inwe ase inwe, kera oyomo nekeegwa eke anyorete, buna abarendi abaya b’obuya bwa Nyasae, obore ne chingencho chinyinge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto karakwane, tiga akwane amang’ana a Nyasae. Omonto karabe omokoreri, tiga akorere ne chinguru echio Nyasae amoeire, erinde Nyasae atogigwe ase amang’ana onsi goetera ase Yeso Kristo. Asare ere obonene na okobua kare na kare. Amina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Chandeka buna Omokristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanchani, timokumia ase obokong’u obore buna omorero, obwo bwabaikeire ase okobateema, buna namang’ana amageni abanyorire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende ekiagera mwabwatanire nemechando ya Kristo, goka, erinde ase okomaanorwa kw’obonene bwaye monyare kogoka boigo, na gochenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Komorachaywe ase engencho y’erieta ria Kristo, imosesenirie ekiagera Omoika bw’obonene noyo o Nyasae nigo oikaransete igoro yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onde omo oino taba omoiti, gose omoibi, gose omokori amabe, gose oyokwerosia ase amang’ana ’abaanto bande, erinde abaise gochandwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende onye omonto ogochandwa ekiagera are Omokristo tarora obosooku, korende atogie Nyasae ase erieta eri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naki engaki yaikire ekiina gechakere ase enyomba ya Nyasae na gakerachake ase tore, omoerio obo abwo bataigwereti enchiri ya Nyasae, naki orabe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na, buna eriikire,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "“Onye ekoba aakong’u omonyene oboronge gotooreka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "oria otamoirogeti Nyasae na omonyene ebibe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "naki rende kerabe asare?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "m"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1PE 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio, abwo bagochandwa koreng’ana nogwancha kwa Nyasae, tiga bakore amaya na babeeke emioyo yabo asare ere oyore Omotongi omwegenwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1PE.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1PE.4.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
